OL,3,ADemocrats win control of House of
OL,4,ARepresentatives and make key gains in
OL,5,Abid to retake Senate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats are projected to win a
OL,8,Fmajority in US House of
OL,9,FRepresentatives, taking control from
OL,10,Fthe Republicans
OL,12,FThey are projected to win at least 218
OL,13,Fseats and the Republicans are projected
OL,14,Fto win at least 160 seats, according to
OL,15,Fthe BBC's US partner CBS
OL,17,FThe Democrats also win the Senate seat
OL,18,Fin South Carolina, flipping their
OL,19,Fsecond seat of the night
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
